  "body": "5 Years Master Builders Guarantee Remaining\r\n\r\nLatest designer kitchen, high spec home, this home captures stunning elevated water views and all-day sun. Seamless indoor-outdoor flow leads to a sun-drenched deck and landscaped gardens—perfect for BBQs and gatherings. \r\n\r\nUpgrades include:\r\n• Brand new kitchen benchtop and splashback.\r\n• Converted gas to induction cooktop.\r\n• Replaced carpets with Swedish wood flooring on the stairs, upstairs living area, and master bedroom.\r\n• High-end French-style curtains throughout.\r\n• New side gates and front fence.\r\n• Fresh paint on the front exterior and entire interior.\r\n• Upgraded power sockets and light switches with a modern look.\r\n• New chandelier above the dining table.\r\n• Smart lighting installed in living rooms.\r\n• All retaining walls boxed in for a clean, polished look.\r\n• Built a privacy wall and solid pergola.\r\n• Easy-care garden surrounding the house.\r\n• Elevated 525m² section with a 318m² house floor area.\r\n\r\nThree expansive family rooms offer multiple zones for relaxation and entertainment, with open-plan living areas designed for comfort and connectivity. Modern designer kitchens feature ample pantry space, perfect for family meals and entertaining. Five spacious double bedrooms provide plenty of room for the whole family, complemented by 4.5 beautifully appointed bathrooms, including three luxurious master ensuites on different levels.\r\n\r\nThe versatile layout suits various family needs. The downstairs area features a generous living space and master ensuite with separate entries—ideal for working from home, extended family, teenagers, or home-stays.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned between the Silverdale Shopping Centre, beautiful beaches, and surrounding amenities. Enjoy easy motorway access, just a few minutes' drive to the Silverdale/Millwater centre, Orewa town centre, and Albany. The property is also located near high-decile schools.\r\n\r\nThis is a fantastic family home, ready to move in and enjoy the generous spaces, solid construction, and private garden that make this property truly special.",
